SUMMARY:[Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition][Deep Representation Learnin
 g] ECCV 2026 - Paper registration deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: European Conference on Computer Vision\nWebsi
 te: https://eccv.ecva.net/Conferences/2026\nSource URL: https://eccv.ecva
 .net/Conferences/2026/Dates\nLocation: Malmo\, Sweden\nTopics: Computer V
 ision & Pattern Recognition\, Deep Representation Learning\, Machine Lear
 ning\nSize: XXL\nSubmission type: Paper-based / Springer proceedings\nCon
 fidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Completed 2026 
 edition retained for the archive. Official dates use 23:00 CET for regist
 ration/papers (22:00 UTC)\, but camera-ready is AoE. ECCV is biennial in 
 even years. XXL is supported by the 2024 organizers' report of 6\,705 par
 ticipants.\nScope: Broad research in visual perception\, representation l
 earning\, recognition\, segmentation\, 3D geometry and reconstruction\, c
 omputational imaging\, and image/video synthesis. Vision-language models\
 , multimodal understanding\, human motion and appearance\, and robust vis
 ual systems extend this core. ECCV is the biennial European flagship for 
 computer vision\; the scope uses the actual published 2026 CFP\, not an i
 nvented 2028 call.\nAdditional topics: Computer Graphics & Visualization\
 , Multimedia Learning & Retrieval\, Natural Language Processing & LLMs\, 
 Biometrics & Human Sensing\, Robustness & Safety\nScope sources (2026): h
 ttps://eccv.ecva.net/Conferences/2026/CallForPapers\nScope last checked: 
 2026-10-07
